(Project Title: Low-Cost Spectroscopic Monitoring of Urban Watersheds) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The National Science Foundation \(the "Foundation"\) hereby awards a grant to the Recipient) Tj T*
(Organization for support of the project described in the proposal referenced above. This) Tj T*
(agreement incorporates the Foundation's general research terms and conditions and the) Tj T*
(cost principles set out in 2 CFR Part 200, as supplemented below.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. PERIOD OF PERFORMANCE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The award supports work conducted during the period of performance beginning January 1, 2026) Tj T*
(and ending December 31, 2026. Costs incurred before the start date or after the end date are) Tj T*
(not allowable charges to this award unless the Grants Officer authorizes them in writing,) Tj T*
(including any pre-award costs or no-cost extension.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. APPROVED BUDGET) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Foundation approves the following direct cost budget. Amounts are the maximum the) Tj T*
(Recipient may charge to each category without further approval, subject to the re-budgeting) Tj T*
(provisions in Section 4.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(| Budget Category        | Approved Amount |) Tj T*
(|------------------------|-----------------|) Tj T*
(| Personnel              | $180,000.00     |) Tj T*
(| Fringe                 | $54,000.00      |) Tj T*
(| Equipment              | $25,000.00      |) Tj T*
(| Travel                 | $8,000.00       |) Tj T*
(| Materials & Supplies   | $6,000.00       |) Tj T*
(| Subawards              | $60,000.00      |) Tj T*
(| Participant Support    | $10,000.00      |) Tj T*
(| Total Direct Costs     | $343,000.00     |) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Participant support costs are restricted to stipends, travel and subsistence for workshop) Tj T*
(participants and may not be re-budgeted into other categories without prior written approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. INDIRECT COSTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Indirect costs \(facilities and administrative costs, "F&A"\) are awarded at the Recipient's) Tj T*
(negotiated rate of 26% of modified total direct costs \(MTDC\). For this award, MTDC excludes) Tj T*
(equipment, participant support costs, rental costs, tuition remission, scholarships, patient) Tj T*
(care, and the portion of each subaward in excess of the first $50,000. The Recipient must) Tj T*
(apply this rate consistently and may not recover indirect costs on excluded items.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. RE-BUDGETING AND PRIOR APPROVAL) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The Recipient may re-budget among direct cost categories to meet project needs. Prior) Tj T*
(approval from the Grants Officer is required where the cumulative amount of such transfers) Tj T*
(exceeds ten percent of the total approved budget, consistent with 2 CFR 200.308.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5. UNALLOWABLE COSTS) Tj T*
() Tj T*
